cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Argentina Oil & Gas — open production dashboard
message: >-
  If you use this dashboard or its derived data, please cite the underlying
  data publishers as well as this work. The data is not mine; the analysis is.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Maximilian Haas
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/"
abstract: >-
  Interactive static-site analysis of Argentina's public well-level oil and gas
  production data (2006-2025), joined to the official hydraulic fracture record
  to derive well trajectory and completion intensity.

references:
